Package: taco
Type: Package
Title: Read TACO Datasets
Version: 0.4.0
Authors@R: person("Cesar", "Aybar", email = "cesar@asterisk.coop",
    role = c("aut", "cre"))
Description: Read TACO v3 datasets through the DuckDB 'cozip' extension.
    The package exposes dataset contracts and reads ZIP, FOLDER, and TACOCAT
    containers through one API.
